                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "wow, yup. This game is difficult, short, and sweet. I wasn't clear on this when I bought it but you actually control the ball with your camera. Sometimes, you can cheese the next checkpoint by rotating the mouse well enough, which I liked. The camera controls can also be slightly frustrating at times, and might cause some users to get motion sickness- but to me that was part of the charm and unique mechanics. At the time of this review, I currently sit at an extremely humble 9th place (LAST PLACE) on the global leaderboards with a 1 hour long run (you get +time penalty on death).",
